# SixLabors.ImageSharp 3.1.12 (fixed in 4.1.2), a transitive dependency of
# Scryber.Core, which pins 3.1.12 up to its latest release (9.7.5).
# GrandNode does not reference ImageSharp; Scryber.Imaging only detects and
# decodes images (TiffFormat, TiffMetadata, DecoderOptions). The affected code
# is never called: the TIFF CCITT T4/T6 encoders and HistogramEqualization.
# Drop these entries once Scryber.Core moves to ImageSharp 4.1.2 or later.
